{
	"_doc": "Trials of the Wächterin (docs/raetsel_konzept.md). `wisp` = tuning of every wisp trail (px, px/s, seconds). `placed`: the trials in the world; a wisp trail has `tile` (the bowl), `route` (tiles: the first point is the bowl, the last is where it sinks into the ground, checked flat level-0 land away from water and the void), `stops` (route indices where it hovers and waits for her), `linger` (stops where it circles something curious first), `tier` (the chest). `crow` = tuning of the crow's hoard; a hoard has `tile` (the crow's snag), `variant` (0 lightning stump, 1 ring stump, 2 crooked stump, 3 rock; default by its id) and `mound` (where it hid its finds). `weave` = tuning of every root weave (Wurzelgeflecht, seconds/px; a weave has `tile` = the heart, `goal` all|path, `cubes` {id: {kind cube|seed|thorn|heart|crown, at [tiles from the heart], lit, from (the seed it rises from), rune, variant}}, `roots` [[a, b, one_way]]; checked by `py -3 tools/check_root_weave.py`). `stars` = tuning of every star mirror (Sternenspiegel; an entry has `tile` = the pond's centre, `field` [tiles from the pond to the field's centre], `size` tiles, `mirror` x|y|diag, `turn` degrees the reflection turns over the night, `faint` (dim stars hide at new moon), `lines` night|full_moon, `stars` [[u, v, brightness 1-3]] in field units, `links` [[i, j]], `stones` [[tiles from the pond]], more stones than stars = decoys). `trial_world` = the trials of the flat test world (`--trials`, coordinates of that world). `raven` = tuning of the raven trade (`likes` = what it takes as a pawn); a trade also has `stations` (tiles where it drops a feather).",
